    "notes": "Package 6 slot HUD. PROBE-002 (2026-10-23) measured spin, turbo, amplify, bet -/+, autoplay, menu and the buy hitbox (hud_feature_hitbox 0.500, 0.832) from the Phaser scene; the HUD bands are in config/surfaces/package-6.json. PROBE-005 (2026-10-23) mapped the buy panel: four rows at y 0.339 / 0.460 / 0.580 / 0.701 (F1 78x 3 scatters x8, F2 150x 4 scatters x16, F3 288x 5 scatters x32, F4 128x random 3-6), BUY FEATURE at 0.500, 0.929, close at 0.921, 0.248. Dialog and autoplay points start from the Sk8leton template. Scratch drawer stays the shared panel. Regression payloads (2026-10-23): the base tumble multiplier is slot.tumbles[].multiplier.current (1, 2, 4, 8 …) and a bought feature reports its start on the first winning free spin (tumbles[].multiplier.current per item). The start follows the scatters actually dealt on the trigger board (3→8, 4→16, 5→32), which can exceed the tier's guarantee: across 111 Package 6 buys on 2026-10-23 every start matched that table, and the one outlier was a retrigger before the first win. A bought feature's win is credited on the next bet.",
